  {
   "id": "footer-group:footer/slogan",
   "resource_type": "section_group",
   "file_or_handle": "sections/footer-group.json",
   "key_path": "sections.footer.settings.slogan",
   "en": "Your mouth has a rhythm[[br]]Now your oral care too",
   "en_sha1": "2d16442b381544eaac8df6e3b9e0f89522c1f3d8",
   "nl": "Je mond heeft een ritme[[br]]Nu je mondverzorging ook",
   "status": "translated",
   "flags": [],
   "notes": "revised in assembly: approved Figma NL (3738:27474); 22 Oct: Victor 22 Oct: the slogan is 'Your mouth has a rhythm Now your oral care too', two sentences without a stop; NL follows; 22 Oct (R27): [[br]] marks the line break, as in the EN; footer.liquid renders it as <br>"
  },
  {
   "id": "footer-group:footer/copyright_text",
   "resource_type": "section_group",
   "file_or_handle": "sections/footer-group.json",
   "key_path": "sections.footer.settings.copyright_text",
   "en": "<p>Copyright © ∞ KARMICARE. All rights reserved. KARMICARE™ Biorhythmic Toothpaste Kit (Awake + Asleep) is a Belgian product formulated by certified chemists and manufactured under GMP. Formulations are CPNP notified and comply with the EU Cosmetic Regulation (EC) No 1223/2009. Packaging (Awake, Asleep bottle and shipping envelope) are recyclable.</p><p>KARMICARE™ is a brand of KARMICA bv. Vizierstraat 28, 8000, Belgium. Company number 0676.972.896 and VAT number BE0676.972.896 - Belfius: BE73 0689 0664 2960.</p>",
   "en_sha1": "b2d215640991f2039c2d1ca3b244c7f48b57a864",
   "nl": "<p>Copyright © ∞ KARMICARE. Alle rechten voorbehouden. KARMICARE™ Biorhythmic Toothpaste Kit (Awake + Asleep) is een Belgisch product, geformuleerd door gecertificeerde chemici en geproduceerd volgens GMP. De formules zijn aangemeld bij het CPNP en voldoen aan de EU-cosmeticaverordening (EG) nr. 1223/2009. De verpakkingen (flessen van Awake en Asleep en de verzendenvelop) zijn recyclebaar.</p><p>KARMICARE™ is een merk van KARMICA bv. Vizierstraat 28, 8000, Belgium. Ondernemingsnummer 0676.972.896 en btw-nummer BE0676.972.896 - Belfius: BE73 0689 0664 2960.</p>",
   "status": "pending-claim-review",
   "flags": [
    "pending-claim-review"
   ],
   "notes": "Compliance line: 'product' kept as in the EN (regulatory statement). EN address lacks the city (8000 Brugge); kept as EN; R2 (review F8): addresses exactly as in the EN (brief); official Dutch address forms only if Victor decides so"
  },
